    <string name="media_rights_title">Folder rights</string>
    <string name="media_rights_hint">A right applies to this folder and every folder in it, until a folder below sets its own. Read: open and download. Write: also upload, create folders and delete. No access: does not see the folder. The most specific right counts: a person\'s goes before their groups\', a group\'s before the one for all members (someone in several groups gets the most of these). Whoever has no access to the base folder does not see the media library at all. Deleted items go to the trash bin of Nextcloud (if switched on there); a folder can only be deleted by whoever may write everywhere in it.</string>
